Doug pay cash.

12
00:00:16,625 --> 00:00:19,050
Puffin put fifteen dollars in the box.

13
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:19,862
All of it.

14
00:00:19,862 --> 00:00:20,737
Next day.

15
00:00:20,737 --> 00:00:21,837
Same burger.

16
00:00:21,837 --> 00:00:22,850
Same soda.

17
